{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>A sabbath of solemn rest.</b> Some say cessation for soul and body, and others said that it is the cessation of cessation, than which there is none higher, and both are nouns; sometimes this one comes before that one, and they are equal, and it is not far-fetched." "<b>An everlasting statute.</b> To fast."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:29.524325981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}